; Native allied-support RUSA diagnostic squad.
;
; The extra Team-A Mate runs in Dynamic Conquest but does not have the campaign
; stage/catalog state of a real campaign participant. Existing conquest squads
; begin at min_stage(1)+ and are therefore unavailable on that synthetic slot.
;
; This one diagnostic entry is intentionally min_stage(0). It stays inside the
; normal Conquest unitset and uses only existing Code:X breeds, so no global
; unitset replacement is required and the opposing Conquest bot keeps its normal
; catalog/context. It is never added to bot purchase data or player research.
;
; Runtime use is restricted to native_support_birth_probe.lua on the extra Team-A
; Mate. If IsUnitAvailable is not positively true, the probe never calls SpawnAt.

("squad_with5types_conquest" side(rusa) period(2022s)
 min_stage(0) max_stage(99) name(codex_native_support_rifle)
 c1(lud_squadlead:1) c2(lud_lmg:1) c3(lud_rifleman:2) c4(lud_marksman:1) c5(lud_antitank:1))
